# The simulator's own launchd jobs that make a new device's first boot hold the runner's load at 500 to 900 for about
# 15 min (gatefold#198): lock-screen posters, photo and media analysis, search, Siri, widgets, Home, maps, weather and
# trial downloads. scripts/ci-simulator.py removes them once a device passes its check (gatefold#209: XCUITest timed out
# launching the app inside that load). Heaviest first, as the removal stops at its time limit. Gatefold uses none of
# them; never list a job XCUITest needs (accessibility, testmanagerd, runningboardd, SpringBoard).
# Probe 42965000531 removed these plus com.apple.accessibility.axassetsd (left out: accessibility) and
# com.apple.Spotlight (not a launchd job; the Spotlight app runs under UIKitApplication): load under 25 about 4 min
# after the boot and a Settings launch in 0.5 to 2.5 s, against about 18 min and launches of up to 351 s.
com.apple.PosterBoard
com.apple.mediaanalysisd
com.apple.mediaanalysisd.service
com.apple.photoanalysisd
com.apple.searchd
com.apple.corespotlightservice
com.apple.spotlightknowledged
com.apple.spotlightknowledged.updater
com.apple.knowledgeconstructiond
com.apple.hybridsearchd
com.apple.suggestd
com.apple.siriactionsd
com.apple.siriknowledged
com.apple.chronod
com.apple.contacts.postersyncd
com.apple.assetsd
com.apple.assetsd.nebulad
com.apple.cloudphotod
com.apple.managedassetsd
com.apple.homed
com.apple.geod
com.apple.weatherd
com.apple.triald
